# hermes-config-drift-audit
owner: klerik · cadence: every 2h · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that catches Hermes config drift before it silently switches models or breaks TTS?**

## Prompt
Each tick: read all profile configs; verify fallback_providers has z-ai/glm-5.3-flash first, auxiliary.compression is explicit, and auxiliary.vision is pinned; flag any drift and append findings to wiki/concepts/hermes-config-drift-audit.md.

## Evidence
> my model keeps switching the step 3.7 flash
> The JWT-based entitlement cache... goes stale when credits are added
> fix identified but not confirmed applied → teknium
